      "role": "角色",
      "positive": {
        "zh": "她仰躺在柜底，后脑枕着深处的玩偶，裙摆前片贴着前窗。她把两膝抬高，分别朝左右柜壁弯开。两条小腿从膝头折向前窗，鞋跟略向中间收，低于同侧膝盖。两脚悬在玻璃内侧，左右鞋底朝向镜头，在画面下方各占一侧。她的脸和衬衫领口从两鞋上方露出来，双手搭在腹部。",
        "en": "She lies on her back on the cabinet floor, her head resting on the toys at the far end and the front panel of her skirt against the front window. She draws both knees up and angles one toward each side wall. From each raised knee the shin folds toward the front window. Each heel sits slightly inward and lower than its knee. Both shoes hover just inside the glass, their soles facing the camera, one on each side of the lower foreground. Her face and shirt collar are visible above the shoes. Her hands rest on her belly."
      }
